# Sculk sensor (category sculk): a lever click 3 blocks away reaches it 3gt later; it is then
# active for 30gt (power on every side, strong power into the block below), then 10gt of
# cooldown. The torch on the block below goes dark 2gt after the sensor wakes and relights 2gt
# after it sleeps: both lever edges give the same 30gt window. A piston moving 3 blocks away
# wakes it just the same (it hears pistons within 8 blocks).
design designs/gadgets/sculk-hold.txt
probe T 4 0 0
probe P 6 0 0
quiet 5
use 0 1 0
expect_trace T 11110000000000000000000000000000001
quiet 15
use 0 1 0
expect_trace T 11110000000000000000000000000000001
quiet 15
set 6 0 1 minecraft:redstone_block
expect_trace T 111110000000000000000000000000000001
